OL,3,CSix homes on fire and two injured in
OL,4,Cgolf course blaze
OL,6,FSix homes are on fire and two people
OL,7,Fare injured as 60 firefighters tackle
OL,8,Fan "extensive" grass fire near a golf
OL,9,Fcourse.
OL,11,F12 crews were called to the Racecourse
OL,12,FLane area in Stourbridge just before
OL,13,F1.30pm today (Thursday).
OL,15,FOunty John Lane and Stourbridge Road
OL,16,Fare also affected by the fire, with
OL,17,Femergency services saying they have
OL,18,Fincreased their resources at the scene.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/4
