OL,3,CSix homes on fire and two injured in
OL,4,Cgolf course blaze
OL,6,FWest Midlands Fire Service has said:
OL,7,F"Flames are spreading across roads in
OL,8,Fplaces.
OL,10,F"Please avoid the area."
OL,12,FThe service also reported that a
OL,13,Fnumber of properties in the
OL,14,Fsurrounding area are experiencing
OL,15,Fpower issues.
OL,17,FThey estimate the fire involves an
OL,18,Farea of around 40 acres, including a
OL,19,Fwood.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/4
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
