OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786727921
OL,3,CSix homes on fire and two injured in
OL,4,Cgolf course blaze
OL,6,FPeople are being urged to avoid the
OL,7,Farea where possible and also urging
OL,8,Fpeople to keep doors and windows
OL,9,Fclosed as a precaution.
OL,11,FNetwork Rail has said all services
OL,12,Fbetween Stourbridge Junction and
OL,13,FHagley are currently suspended due the
OL,14,Ffire alongside the track.
OL,16,FIn a statement on X, formerly Twitter,
OL,17,Fthe railway company said: "Due to a
OL,18,Flineside fire in Stourbridge, all
OL,19,Fservices between Stourbridge Junction
OL,20,Fand Hagley are currently suspended."
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/4
